# …except the mail logo. mail.service.ts attaches it by path on every OTP and
# verification email, so a clone without it throws ENOENT and registration
# returns a 500. It is a build asset, not a screenshot — nest-cli.json already
# copies **/*.png into dist/server for exactly this file.
!Lumen-backend/server/mail/lumen_logo.png
*.tiff

# macOS
.DS_Store
